## 3-PHASE WORKFLOW

> **Full Specification**: See `@01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

| Phase | Name | What Happens | Stop Point? |
|-------|------|--------------|-------------|
| **0** | Ingest & Infer | Detect mode (A/B). Mode A: LLM reads the prior email / screenshot description natively and extracts everything. Auto-set today's date. Build draft state. **Silent.** | No |
| **1** | Per-Section Updates | Present all 6 inferred sections + leaves prompt + Jira prompt + free-form. User replies ONCE with all updates. Bidirectional sycophancy guard runs. | **Stop #1** |
| **2** | Draft, Validate, Approve | LLM parses Jira paste; assemble full draft; render inline plain-text preview; run all 6 validators silently; show inline gap list; write 4-file timestamped bundle. User approves / edits / aborts. | **Stop #2** |

**Total stop points: 2**

