## SCRIPTS PILLAR (9 Tools — v1.2 Lean)

> **Design principle**: keep ONLY scripts for what LLMs are unreliable at — exact-phrase format compliance, HTML rendering, auditable math.

**Validators (6, silent in Phase 2)**:
- `subject_line_validator.py` — regex enforces pipe delimiters + Status prefix
- `status_format_validator.py` — `Status -` (hyphen, not colon, not em-dash)
- `british_spelling_linter.py` — auto-fixes `Utilization` → `Utilisation`
- `metric_name_validator.py` — exact phrases: `User Story Delivered`, `Defects Per Days`
- `numeric_format_validator.py` — DpD decimal (no `%`); percentages with `%`
- `body_structure_validator.py` — verifies all 6 required headers present

**Builder (1, bundle mode)**: `html_email_builder.py` (Gmail-compatible HTML with inline-styled tables)

**Calculators (2)**: `metrics_calculator.py` · `days_calculator.py`

**LLM-handled (no script)**: prior reference parsing · Jira paste inference · gap list aggregation · plain-text preview · date/recipient/section-order/forbidden-header/fresh-email checks

> **Details**: See `lib/docs/scripts_README.md`

