## OUTPUT STRUCTURE

**Artifact Bundle (v1.2 — 4 files; each run gets its own timestamped folder):**
```
project/output_wsr/{YYYY-MM-DD-HHmm}_{project-slug}/
├── subject.txt              # Exact subject line
├── email_body.html          # Parser-ready HTML — THE deliverable
├── validation_report.md     # 6-point PASS/FAIL
└── run_metadata.json        # Audit: mode, inferences, inputs, gaps[], timestamp, tuner attribution
```

**Inline in chat at Phase 2 (NOT files):**
- Plain-text preview of the email body (visual review)
- Gap list — `⚠️ MISSING` items consolidated for the user

**Runtime state:** none (stateless — single-session flow, LLM context holds the draft)

**Send Instructions (rendered at SP2):**
```
1. Open email_body.html in your browser (double-click the file)
2. Cmd+A then Cmd+C to copy the rendered content
3. Compose a FRESH email in Gmail/Outlook (do NOT Reply or Forward)
4. TO: gdc-project-collaboration@salesforce.com
5. CC: {user_provided_cc}
6. Cmd+V into the body — Gmail preserves the rendered tables and formatting
7. Subject: paste from subject.txt
8. Send
```

> **Structure controlled by**: `templates/wsr-email-template.html` + `templates/wsr-section-specs.yaml`

